, i.e. (figuratively), equitable, correct, or (abstractly), integrity","kjv_def":"plain, right, uprightness.","n":4,"o":"2SA15:3 PRO8:9 PRO24:26 ISA57:2"},"H5229":{"lemma":"נְכֹחָה","xlit":"nᵉkôchâh","pron":"nek-o-khaw'","derivation":"feminine of H5228 (נָכֹחַ);","strongs_def":"properly, straightforwardness, i.e. (figuratively) integrity, or (concretely) a truth","kjv_def":"equity, right (thing), uprightness.","n":4,"o":"ISA26:10 ISA30:10 ISA59:14 AMO3:10"},"H5230":{"lemma":"נָכַל","xlit":"nâkal","pron":"naw-kal'","derivation":"a primitive root;","strongs_def":"to defraud, i.e. act treacherously","kjv_def":"beguile, conspire, deceiver, deal subtilly.","n":4,"o":"GEN37:18 NUM25:18 PSA105:25 MAL1:14"},"H5231":{"lemma":"נֵכֶל","xlit":"nêkel","pron":"nay'-kel","derivation":"from H5230 (נָכַל);","strongs_def":"deceit","kjv_def":"wile.","n":1,"o":"NUM25:18"},"H5232":{"lemma":"נְכַס","xlit":"nᵉkaç","pron":"nek-as'","derivation":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H5233 (נֶכֶס)","strongs_def":"{treasure}","kjv_def":"goods.","n":2,"o":"EZR6:8 EZR7:26"},"H5233":{"lemma":"נֶכֶס","xlit":"nekeç","pron":"neh'-kes","derivation":"from an unused root meaning to accumulate;","strongs_def":"treasure","kjv_def":"riches, wealth.","n":5,"o":"JOS22:8 2CH1:11 2CH1:12 ECC5:19 ECC6:2"},"H5234":{"lemma":"נָכַר","xlit":"nâkar","pron":"naw-kar'","derivation":"a primitive root;","strongs_def":"properly, to scrutinize, i.e. look intently at; hence (with recognition implied), to acknowledge, be acquainted with, care for, respect, revere, or (with suspicion implied), to disregard, ignore, be strange toward, reject, resign, dissimulate (as if ignorant or disowning)","kjv_def":"acknowledge, [idiom] could, deliver, discern, dissemble, estrange, feign self to be another, know, take knowledge (notice), perceive, regard, (have) respect, behave (make) self strange(-ly).","n":47,"o":"GEN27:23 GEN31:32 GEN37:32 GEN37:33 GEN38:25 GEN38:26 GEN42:7 GEN42:8 DEU1:17 DEU16:19 DEU21:17 DEU32:27 DEU33:9 JDG18:3 RUT2:10 RUT